    "Content": "<p>Translator Text now supports five new languages&mdash;Irish, Punjabi, Malayalam, Kannada, and Portuguese (Portugal). See <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/Translator/language-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">more information</a> on other languages that Translator supports.&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
